From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flysoft <flysoftbeta@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:05:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 19/34] Recover PRTS native capture startup and probe keyed
 export support

Fall back to CPU if native GMB capture never starts or delivers an unsupported handle; test NT keyed texture allocation before advertising GPU mode. Format the M4 capture/export code.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

